#: manual/design/mutable/dense.md:46
#: manual/design/mutable/sparse.md:46
#: manual/design/mutable/term.md:40
msgid "Correctness / invariants"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/consistency.md:37
msgid "The package has no runtime code. Its invariant is that `moon test` passes: every equation above holds on the tested inputs."
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/consistency.md:39
#: manual/design/core.md:159
#: manual/design/immut.md:43
#: manual/design/immut/context.md:121
#: manual/design/immut/dense.md:130
#: manual/design/immut/sparse.md:71
#: manual/design/immut/term.md:78
#: manual/design/internal.md:49
#: manual/design/mutable.md:67
