#: manual/design/mutable/dense.md:54
#: manual/design/mutable/sparse.md:53
#: manual/design/mutable/term.md:47
msgid "Alternatives rejected"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/consistency.md:41
msgid "**Tests inside `mutable`** would let the mutable layer's tests silently depend on immutable internals and could not be reused for other layers."
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/consistency.md:42
msgid "**Exhaustive property tests across all pairs of representations** would multiply test time; the package checks representative operations, and the property tests stay with the individual laws."
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/consistency.md:44
